Choose your own python interpreter

If you don't have any, I recommend download and install python from the official website
> https://www.python.org/downloads/

To manage and modify cardDatabase.csv
- Run cs.py 
    with command in terminal "py cs.py" in the source file directory in the original python interpreter
    or with methods you're choosing from your own interpreter

However the necessary module and function of cs.py is already included in the main Algorithm (tol.py)

Run tol.py
    - type in terminal "$dir/py tol.py" or with your own methods
    - Specify the file to store the card database (cardDatabase.csv for default)
    - After the program successfully started the program will wait for inputs from the corresponding machine

    We use keyboard for simulating the sensors:
    - [Esc] key to exit the simulation
    - [Enter/Return] key to run the main toll program (if a vehicle is detected)
    - [1] key to call for help
    - [2] key to manage card database (this will automatically run the necessary commands from cs.py)
